{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d5916eefd4cc2dc67c4be159bb0734df7b66a16c9f137bb11829625f23cd2c73","ja":"ありがとうございます。\nおふたりのおかげで、自信をもって教壇に向かえます！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"aed92382c4ee8a611bb82e5330157a6f96ca4541f146c5b2ab379fc4b64f3ff0","ja":"そして紬の一日署長が行われた。\nその翌日……","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"5ebf5a9398a379d9790d4426c6476118cfaef8695c67f61c30430ed525bcacc8","ja":"あ、ネットニュースになってますよ！\n「凛としたアイドル署長、警察署に降臨！」って！","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"82c1c4f79d8023215a8ea414180d578ccbce21d2fa9ea43f4f175c2b913393d9","ja":"制服も、なまら似合ってるし、\n立派な一日署長だったんだねぇ。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"f5ecdaa9a61547cb2b1e37f49a2d5ac5a68e177856a03dc9e2ac012a7e0c8693","ja":"そんな……褒めすぎです。それに交通安全教室の成功は\nおふたりのお力添えがあってこそですから。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"1b8fd76c75ad2902a9e745dfe352498682c860898a821b8a1db9a8a982294088","ja":"それに、実際に授業を行うことで\n改善点が見つかりました。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"4b114c4639e4d8156a09ac8f34dd3f0a63943b85805bc750fc112cfa8082d150","ja":"もしよろしければ、また、\n練習に付き合っていただけませんでしょうか。","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"d9978c71ea99fc212ad091fe7c650531010df5b86ffd135b4845815c37399044","ja":"えっ？　一日署長は終わったのに……ですか？","zh":"","status":"untranslated","translation_stage":"untranslated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
